  "body": "[Some Twitter discussion](https://twitter.com/rektide/status/795450600766967812) seems confused about this, and I admit I don't remember thinking about it.\r\n\r\n@bmeck claims there are idempotency problems with these, and I vaguely recall him outlining them to me, but they have slipped my mind.\r\n\r\n`javascript:` URLs will fail in the fetching phase currently; we could outlaw them earlier if we wanted. Per https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#basic-fetch currently about/blob/data/file/ftp/filesystem/http/https will all work.\r\n\r\n/cc @whatwg/modules ",
